+## CI
+
+The existing STM32 CI now triggers on `CANComm/**` changes and requires the
+strict A02.1 real adapter composition. The historical `--expect-baseline-failure`
+mode is expressly **not** a CI requirement; it is permitted only at its exact
+A02.1 SHA. `actions/checkout@v4` shallow cloning does not inhibit strict mode.
+
+## Limitations
+
+No complete source checkout/ARM toolchain/SIL Kit was available for executing
+all production and host tests in this container. Passing local checks of patch
+format do not establish firmware runtime correctness or physical safety.
